{"archive":{"bytes":24027236,"complete":false,"hash":null,"images_lost":false,"truncated":false},"cover_img":"https://p11-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-d77oumduh0/%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91.gif~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.gif?rk3s=a5b7ebca&x-expires=2098787386&x-signature=KA4HDneKsA0jmjRGiz1nQulwBIU%3D","discovered_at":"2026-09-02T05:49:53.537Z","html":"<html>\n<body>\n<h1>Seedream 5.0 Pro</h1>\n<p>Seedream 5.0 Pro 是具备智能思考、高效创作和生产的多模态图像生成模型</p>\n<h1>高密度信息呈现</h1>\n<p>驾驭复杂信息组织，实现细分设计和教育办公场景的效果直出。</p>\n<p>一张解释六大茶类的信息图。画面中心是一个风味轮图表，由细腻的水彩渐变构成。风味轮周围环绕着俯拍茶叶图像，呈现不同氧化程度的茶叶状态。连接线将茶叶与氧化百分比柱状图和冲泡温度温度计相连。背景为带纹理的手工宣纸。整体布局极简、禅意、精致，构图平衡。</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a548f8879e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=EedcBgPBKK09LOcXyz19UWU9ME0%3D\"/>\n<p>未来主义跑车的技术图纸，蓝图风格。跑车的正面、侧面、背面的线稿，拆解零件的稿图，零件拼接图，拆解零件的构造图，应使用大量线条和测量值来指示各个部位的尺寸，用灰度表达整体素描关系。除了主要设计外，还需展示不同角度的零散缩略图。</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a56059079e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=DiihbtaqVtp7pY9DVgoUk8FXBwk%3D\"/>\n<p>一个极其复杂、信息密度极高的 RPG 角色界面。画面中包含密集排列的角色属性栏、用于经验成长的复杂折线图，以及一个巨大的地形迷你地图。美学风格：高端工业功能主义。深哑光石板灰背景。清晰的白色等宽字体。克制的色彩，使用低饱和金色，用 1px 网格线分隔所有数据，细节极其丰富。</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a5454f179e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=scQfeGgB0JyaGsPFCd6Dvx5TQio%3D\"/>\n<p>竖版 9:16 教育信息图海报，主题：“什么是蒙特梭利教育？”，面向家长设计，风格温暖、友好、专业且易于理解。柔和配色：暖象牙白、浅木色、鼠尾草绿和奶油黄；干净留白，现代极简布局。...... [省略约 570 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p11-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/35eae7717abb11f1906ecc40f3a04725.jpeg~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098868017&amp;x-signature=DnXduDh%2B76FlJBQVPuAiUGJJwXE%3D\"/>\n<p>生成一张 4x4 的电影故事板，共 16 个独立面板，每个面板有清晰黑色边框，按从左到右、从上到下排列，并在每格左上角标注小号编号 1–16。主题是 中世纪骑兵冲锋。整体风格为专业电影制作分镜草图，石墨铅笔绘制，灰阶，带有导演分镜稿质感。...... [省略约 3000 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a54707479e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=sn2zBZc89H1h68XPE4NolICKmBU%3D\"/>\n<p>16:9 学术信息图海报，用于语言学课堂 PPT，主题：“Chomsky’s Linguistic Theory”（“乔姆斯基的语言学理论”）。面向语言学学生和大学阶段学习者设计。整体干净、现代、专业、易于理解。配色：白色、深海军蓝、柔和蓝灰、鼠尾草绿、低饱和薰衣草紫、炭灰。清晰的版块层级、充足留白、易读字体、结构化学术信息图布局。......[省略约 2500 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p3-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/c779da6d7ad811f19c0100163e2c8080.jpeg~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098929252&amp;x-signature=S9B4FJfqBQ9lTwAkOqNj4%2BlcXrk%3D\"/>\n<p>16:9 宠物电商首屏 UI，日落暖阳色调，分层阴影。顶部导航；左奶油米色背景，含文案、商品卡片、金黄胶囊按钮；右侧金毛图，3D 特效：金毛前爪冲破右框，搭在左侧按钮上。</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/88ef9b9e79ea11f1906ecc40f3a04725.jpeg~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=ejL7GJ1R%2FOx9EtGjgrFyUIAPees%3D\"/>\n<h1>交互式精准编辑</h1>\n<p>精准响应空间标记与涂鸦线稿，支持图层拆分，解锁更多交互编辑可能。</p>\n<p>根据原图中的 6 处紫色框和英文手写体批注进行精确编辑。目标是在保持原始布局和空间内容基本不变的前提下，对客厅进行更温暖、更轻盈、更真实的风格调整。</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a93cf2179e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=p3AVyWLd9NJlOKBcqjw3serEoPw%3D\"/>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a7aa14b79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=PqW4u3agxYI8UXuK6o8EggZymI8%3D\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/8565591579e511f18bab00163e29e00a.png~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=guv1YVu7qgXxAlQoveRKYBMN%2FDI%3D\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p11-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-d77oumduh0/%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91.gif~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.gif?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098787386&amp;x-signature=KA4HDneKsA0jmjRGiz1nQulwBIU%3D\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a92422c79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=GODZfRA7WycrBY3n5Isnki%2FQ8EU%3D\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a8131a279e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=o14%2FR1534AElc4OHcijC7Oonjvw%3D\"/>\n<p>根据批注将真实沙漠蜥蜴进化为水晶龙，同时保留生物结构的合理性。......，输出一张真实摄影与幻想生物无缝融合的电影级画面。[省略约 130 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a82d65a79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=51Rt0cysNxAj11%2FQEv8z3LiZoh0%3D\"/>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a54555679e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=RwJ50RkZuFtVBsAmsiDHH1Noq%2Bk%3D\"/>\n<p>根据图中的所有批注，将白天欧洲街道重构为电影级雨夜追车戏。把红色圈选的黑色轿车变成高速行驶的主角追车车辆，......，输出干净的电影宽银幕剧照，超真实，强叙事，复杂光影一致。[省略约 240 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a8375db79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=ax4McsLvHWolVF%2FmlZ6c%2F12w3Eo%3D\"/>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a54548e79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=WpLgPuRT3Fka4cPWJJv30P5YeNw%3D\"/>\n<p>将这张带批注的手绘草图转化为可发布的高级 SaaS 官网首屏设计，严格保留草图布局结构。红色框主标题区域生成清晰英文标题“Orchestrate AI Workflows at Scale”，副标题为简短的说明。...... [省略约 230 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a83d8e279e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=Ko53PIA31DiHC%2FRRmJNdAIfAsg8%3D\"/>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a54608079e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=Fv6tcAcz3WcQQlAwDgT7B%2B0g5%2BU%3D\"/>\n<h1>真实丰富的影像与人像质感</h1>\n<p>还原真实物理光影与人物肌理，摄影质感大幅提升。</p>\n<p>真实家庭生活摄影，一位黑人父亲坐在客厅地毯上，正在给小女儿梳头。父亲穿简单白色 T 恤和运动裤，神情认真，小女儿坐在他前面的小凳子上，披着毛巾，手里拿着玩具。 ......[Around 90 characters omitted]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a5f38d079e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=EmcVuV81x4D9D1psZLPUYTpgIz0%3D\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a889dea79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=3oFVrwFO0%2FWlTurlgmbDX2RBRsc%3D\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a608bd679e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=bxX4%2Be6MatVN305ArWbTF3rvRu0%3D\"/>\n<p>使用提供的两位女性在网球场上的图像作为基础图像，......将两位女性的妆容改成利落的高级时装秀场美妆风格，将她们的头发改为精致、光亮、后梳式秀场发型。......[省略约 1140 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a89a22479e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=LH3caBjBGxgy1XFHnHX0Hl82TJM%3D\"/>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a60de0579e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=SnCWiQTs9plpsQNDsHJLSFX1uXM%3D\"/>\n<p>为我生成一张照片，一家 11 口人在大别墅里围坐在一起吃饭，大家都看向镜头，右下角时间戳 2009.06.21</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a62ec8c79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=B0BeB%2BPIBNidGn5mtGHJenxNX9k%3D\"/>\n<p>去掉模特脸上的斑点、痘印和汗珠；以她的左脸为标准，将两边脸调整对称；再将脖子稍微加长一些。所有调整保持真实自然，避免过度磨皮和变形。</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a8a6eb179e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=wbyJlyrnkbTqMZimOPqyzlHy%2Fbw%3D\"/>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a656f4a79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=%2BZ801%2F55mVShwoOrBcL4rh0N2SM%3D\"/>\n<h1>多语种原生支持</h1>\n<p>原生支持十余种世界常用语言的直接输入与高质量生成，适配全球化的创作环境。</p>\n<p>生成一张地铁站公共安全提示海报，竖版 4:5。风格为现代公共交通导视，白底、黄色警示色和黑色图标。文字内容使用四种语言并排：英文、中文、日语、韩语。......[省略约 413 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a547c0a79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=M6otcDiOxdzA9rvrz5kh303GIUU%3D\"/>\n<p>Crea una infografía vertical 4:5 sobre la cultura del Día de los Muertos en México. Usa ilustraciones claras de altar, flores de cempasúchil, calaveras de azúcar, velas, pan de muerto y fotografías familiares.（制作一张关于墨西哥亡灵节文化的竖版 4:5 信息图。使用清晰的祭坛、万寿菊、糖骷髅、蜡烛、亡灵面包和家庭照片插画。）</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a5dc8f079e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=FfamIsR%2FNMvxhOfe08ImPiaGfaM%3D\"/>\n<p>১৬:৯ দৃশ্য তৈরি করুন: নদীর ধারে শান্ত গ্রাম, নৌকা, সোনালি সূর্যাস্ত, ধানের ক্ষেত, কুয়াশা এবং কবিতাময় বাস্তবধর্মী আলো, কোনো লেখা নয়।（创建一个 16:9 场景：河边宁静的村庄、船只、金色日落、稻田、薄雾，以及富有诗意的写实光线，不要文字。）</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a6b054579e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=8hcfqSXbSJUKjF50QmdUOqO15QA%3D\"/>\n<p>保持医疗海报的配色、图标、医生照片、模块结构和整体版式不变，只将全部英文文字翻译为阿拉伯语，并调整为从右到左排版。......[省略约 450 字符]</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a8c992979e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=h31m8Bf2PeLM109uW452EENhw6M%3D\"/>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a76484e79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=YusLYwzM26uT9%2Fuj3njMsu6PvAs%3D\"/>\n<p>日本の6コマ漫画で、バスケットボールが大好きな高校生男子が、ある女生徒に恋をし、努力と成長を経て想いを伝える青春ラブストーリー。白黒のみで、クリーンな手描きの墨線で描かれている。（一部日本 6 格漫画，讲述一名热爱篮球的高中男生爱上某位女生，并在努力与成长之后表达心意的青春爱情故事。画面仅使用黑白，以干净的手绘墨线绘制。）</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a7a038679e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=GD%2F7mg5Elh%2Fp5A4Q%2BhZcZ0ZG%2BUE%3D\"/>\n<p>把菜单翻译成中文。</p>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/b133f81a79ea11f19f8dd264a91873ba.jpeg~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=2zKuSFS9tPTvf8g8fADNO%2B2f250%3D\"/>\n<img alt=\"gradual image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/aca7022b79ea11f19605e8ebd3f91b4a.jpeg~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=NweH8j1l%2BQGWR2%2Bzlolxsu3TiSU%3D\"/>\n<h1>创意无界，探索更多可能</h1>\n<p>浏览精选案例，激发你的下一个灵感。 </p>\n<p>一张环保、视觉舒缓的个人碳足迹减排信息图。背景带有细腻优雅的地形图等高线纹理。版式采用精心制作的 3D 软陶风格图标，包括风力涡轮机、电动汽车和回收标志。数据元素包含简洁精致的竖向柱状图，用于比较不同交通方式的碳排放；中央则是一个大型重叠式维恩图，展示可持续实践。整体配色以柔和的鼠尾草绿、米白色和淡海洋蓝为主。</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a6e6efb79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=0dii94CrpImWeCMekYb6DE54xOU%3D\"/>\n<p>三个年轻朋友赤脚在城市公园喷泉的浅水中玩耍，黑白纪实胶片摄影，抓拍式纪实动作镜头。</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a6b6b1c79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=YntUswC3wt%2BAVbDjL4qQ17XdxwE%3D\"/>\n<p>一位七十多岁或八十多岁的老年白人男性，独自坐在户外游泳池旁一把亮钴蓝色塑料椅上，......这位男性皮肤浅色，有富有表现力的皱纹、银白色头发，以及自信、略显无聊的表情。他平静地直视镜头。佩戴超大方形太阳镜，镜片为半透明柠檬黄色。......编辑纪实写实风格，35mm 镜头质感，高分辨率时尚摄影，自然阳光，人物清晰对焦，背景稍柔。氛围优雅、古怪、电影感且原创。[省略约 660 字符]</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a6b68cf79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=TJjvp30csttMYEJfd9gmlVq9ro8%3D\"/>\n<p>根据图中的美妆修图批注进行编辑。</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%9B%BE/5a8beb6b79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=B%2Ff37ZJYL9lBkzpcIeAK5Us%2FTBI%3D\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a663d8b79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=qewhiwA6zrXLz4qX8RzxbSWK2hQ%3D\"/>\n<p>一张令人惊叹的超宽 17:9 分层热带泻湖照片，画面一半在水上、一半在水下，拍摄于原始火山岛海岸线边缘。图像应具有高端自然摄影竞赛作品的质感：真实、沉浸、清晰、电影感，并充满清新的热带氛围。相机正好位于水线位置，创造干净的水上/水下透视。水平水面横穿画面中部，略带自然波动，上半部分展示葱郁海岸景观，下半部分展示清澈绿松石色水下岩石和珊瑚礁。......[省略约 1200 字符]</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a6a5f4a79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=y0KNltZEXUkWZ80sQ%2FfPRrQDTNk%3D\"/>\n<p>生成一张咖啡机的电商产品详情页。</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a67482779e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=Rv0cY%2BTt8zO1%2FPc7xfoqzCRirt4%3D\"/>\n<p>设计一张果酒品牌“小我果酒”的电商产品详情页，竖版长图。内容结构包括：1.头图区：产品主图+品牌名称+产品名称+一句话卖点“真实果酿，山野的味道”；2.卖点区：3个核心卖点；3.场景区：使用场景图：露营微醺、闺蜜聚会、天台日落、周末小酌；4.产品参数：规格信息+价格，价格9.9元/罐；5.产品品牌故事；6.售后保障+购买引导。视觉风格清新自然，主色调浅绿+米白，与品牌海报风格统一。</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a66fad679e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=kZBwKHcQejdvYD5IfEFGLt6CaOE%3D\"/>\n<p>\"极具动态感的夸张透视。一名风格化动漫战士从天空笔直俯冲而下，将一支巨大的长矛直指摄像机镜头。碎石悬浮在空中。动漫工作室原画风格，可见蓝色和红色铅笔布局线，高能动作分镜。 \"</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a68709c79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=3wvsiy6RXdJCojkx7TMb%2F1Kfvf4%3D\"/>\n<p>广告摄影，一男一女正在穿着为英国山区跑步耐力赛设计的运动服装狂奔，画面扑面而来的是他们狂奔溅起的泥水，但没有拍到他们的脸，画面富有冲击力。</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://p26-magicarena-online-sign.byteimg.com/dp-prompt/evaluation/images/%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9Cpic1/5a6e2ace79e511f18bab00163e29e00a~tplv-d77oumduh0-watermark_ai_compression.webp?rk3s=a5b7ebca&amp;x-expires=2098778704&amp;x-signature=6piAcEHYUJN6%2FoN1dPAX5hnOJUA%3D\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","id":"8nuc4VT3","published_at":"2009-06-21T00:00:00+00:00","publisher":"bytedance_seed_zh","quality":"ok","source_id":"bytedance_seed_zh","tags":[],"text_chars":3627,"title":"Seedream 5.0 Pro","url":"https://seed.bytedance.com/zh/seedream5_0_pro"}
